# Only permanents that entered under the Guest's controller's control count, each as it entered (CR 603.6a, 207.2c). On turn three
# Bot1 casts the Guest, and in response Bot2 flashes in a Brazen Borrower: it entered under Bot2's control, so the Guest stays a 2/2
# (it would be the second nonland permanent and make a 3/3 with trample). Bot1's own Black Lotus is then the second (3/3 trample),
# and sacrificing it for mana afterwards changes nothing: it still counts once it has left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mountain
Grand Ball Guest
Black Lotus
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain
Mountain x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Brazen Borrower
Island x18

